---
import { MessageCircle, Utensils, MapPin, Sparkles, Clock, Flame } from '../ui/Icons';
---

<section id="hero" class="scroll-mt-24 relative min-h-[90vh] sm:min-h-screen pt-28 pb-16 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-surface-border">
  <!-- Hero Background Image with Contrast Overlays -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/assets/cartel-neon-ladrillo.jpg"
      alt="Cartel neón rojo de Cosme Alberdi sobre pared de ladrillo visto"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.38] contrast-125 scale-105 transform motion-safe:animate-pulse-subtle"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      width="1920"
      height="1080"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-canvas-dark via-canvas-dark/60 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial-gradient from-transparent via-black/40 to-black/80"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Decorative Neon Ambient Glows -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-cosme-red/15 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-cosme-amber/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Content Container -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    <!-- Top Pill Tag -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-4 rounded-full bg-surface-card/90 border border-surface-border backdrop-blur-md text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-8 shadow-xl">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cosme-red animate-ping"></span>
      <span class="text-cosme-red">Boulevard Rondeau 1602</span>
      <span class="text-textSecondary">·</span>
      <span class="text-cosme-amber">Barrio Alberdi</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline with Display Typography -->
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white uppercase mb-6 drop-shadow-2xl">
      Donde el <span class="text-cosme-amber">ladrillo</span> se cruza con el <span class="text-cosme-red glow-red">neón</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle / Value Proposition -->
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-xl text-textSecondary leading-relaxed font-sans mb-10">
      De día, el ritual del café de especialidad y brunch artesanal. De noche, neón rojo, canillas de birra tirada, cascada de cheddar caliente y fiestas retro inolvidables.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs Row -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto mb-12">
      <!-- WhatsApp CTA -->
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5493416802275?text=Hola%20Cosme%20Alberdi!%20Quiero%20hacer%20una%20reserva%20para%20esta%20semana."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-cosme-red hover:bg-cosme-redDark shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,30,39,0.45)] hover:shadow-[0_0_45px_rgba(255,30,39,0.7)] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
      >
        <MessageCircle className="w-5 h-5" />
        <span>Reservar Mesa por WhatsApp</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Menu Jump CTA -->
      <a
        href="#menu-interactivo"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-textPrimary bg-surface-card/90 hover:bg-white/15 border border-surface-border hover:border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
      >
        <Utensils className="w-5 h-5 text-cosme-amber" />
        <span>Ver Carta Completa</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Status / Badges Footnote -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 w-full max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">
        <Clock className="w-4 h-4 text-cosme-amber" />
        <span>Mar a Dom desde 08:00 hs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">
        <Flame className="w-4 h-4 text-cosme-red" />
        <span>Parrilla & Cheddar Libre</span>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">
        <Sparkles className="w-4 h-4 text-[#59BD95]" />
        <span>Espacio Pet Friendly & Deck</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
